; The shape of nsec3.test. -- ent.salt.test. exists only through
; deep.ent.salt.test. -- signed with a salt; a prover that hashes with
; hardcoded parameters rather than the zone's NSEC3PARAM finds none of the
; three records RFC 5155 7.2.2 asks for.
salt.test.		300	IN SOA	ns.salt.test. hostmaster.salt.test. 1 3600 600 86400 300
salt.test.		300	IN NS	ns.salt.test.
ns.salt.test.		300	IN A	@ns.ip@
deep.ent.salt.test.	300	IN A	192.0.2.1
